<div class="relative text-gray-200 bg-cover c-opinions">
  <div class="~pt-16/40 ~pb-16/40">
    <div class="~mb-12/24 text-center">
      <div class="js-fadeInChildren">
        <div class="siema"
             id="opinions">
          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
              <p itemprop="text"
                 class="font-roslindale mb-8 ~text-2xl/4xl max-w-[40ch] ml-auto mr-auto">cutme impressed us with their efficient and 
                professional manner - an approach that not only
                inspired confidence, but generated the results we
                were looking for.</p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Ahane Kmiecik, Veritas Wave</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
              <p itemprop="text"
                 class="font-roslindale mb-8 ~text-2xl/4xl max-w-[40ch] ml-auto mr-auto">
                 I am impressed by the professionalism - reliability,
                 punctuality, great contact and very high quality of code.
                 I&nbsp;can safely say that he is one of my best co-workers.</p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Marcin Kapiński, CEO Inbudo.pl</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
              <p itemprop="text"
                 class="font-roslindale mb-8 ~text-2xl/4xl max-w-[40ch] ml-auto mr-auto">
                 Very punctual, conscientious and reliable.
                 I&nbsp;recommend cooperation with cutme!</p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Jakub Zajdel, Consulting &amp; More</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
              <p itemprop="text"
                 class="font-roslindale mb-8 ~text-2xl/4xl max-w-[40ch] ml-auto mr-auto">
                 I like working with cutme because it is&nbsp;characterized by a&nbsp;minimum of&nbsp;words
                 and a&nbsp;maximum of specifics received</p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Adam Pioch, Toastmasters International</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
