                 I ordered a cut-up project from a graphic designer to a&nbsp;character
                 skin for the Wordpress platform. I&nbsp;got a&nbsp;working skin in&nbsp;3&nbsp;days.
                 I&nbsp;definitely recommend it and it's definitely worth the money.</p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Paweł Jóźwik, traffictrends.pl</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>

          <div class="slide">
            <blockquote>
              <p itemprop="text"
                 class="font-roslindale mb-8 ~text-2xl/4xl max-w-[40ch] ml-auto mr-auto">
                 Very good contact with the possibility of refining details
                 and valuable suggestions from your side.
                 An additional advantage is also the affordable price and knowledge 
                 of the latest standards. Full satisfaction. I&nbsp;recommend.
              </p>

              <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">— Damian Zbrożek</p>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>
